Package: iasi.quarto
Type: Package
Title: Build System for Quarto Publications
Version: 0.10.2
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Javier",
    family = "G. Grandez",
    email = "jggrandez@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Discovers, validates, prepares, builds, publishes, and deploys
    Quarto publications from their project structure. The package recognizes
    regular, structured, parted, and direct publication models, generates the
    Quarto artifacts required by each model, and keeps source, build output,
    publication materialization, and deployment as separate concerns.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en
